@startuml alur_crud_proyek_dan_studi_kasus
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #333333
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCCCCC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0

title Diagram Alur REST API: Manajemen Proyek & Detail Studi Kasus

actor "Firman (Admin)" as Admin
participant "ProjectsTab.tsx\n(Daftar Tabel Proyek)" as ProjectsTab
participant "CaseStudyModal.tsx\n(Modal Pratinjau)" as CaseStudyModal
participant "ProjectModal.tsx\n(Form Modal Proyek)" as ProjectModal
participant "API Client / Handler\n(lib/api/projects.ts)" as APIClient
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(Tabel: projects)" as DB
participant "Halaman Web Detail\n(/projects/[id]/page.tsx)" as WebDetailPage

== 1. Membuka & Meninjau Studi Kasus Proyek ==
Admin -> ProjectsTab: Buka menu "Proyek & Portofolio"
activate ProjectsTab
ProjectsTab -> Admin: Menampilkan tabel proyek + badge "Detail Studi Kasus (X Poin)"

Admin -> ProjectsTab: Klik tombol "Detail Studi Kasus" pada baris proyek
ProjectsTab -> CaseStudyModal: Buka modal pratinjau (props: project)
activate CaseStudyModal
CaseStudyModal -> Admin: Menampilkan Pratinjau:\n- Latar Belakang & Solusi (longDescription)\n- Kemampuan Sistem (highlights checklist)\n- Tech Stack (tags) & Key Metrics
deactivate CaseStudyModal

== 2. Mengedit Konten Detail Studi Kasus ==
Admin -> CaseStudyModal: Klik tombol "Edit Detail Studi Kasus"
activate CaseStudyModal
CaseStudyModal -> ProjectModal: openEditCaseStudy(project)\n(Set initialTab = 'case_study')
deactivate CaseStudyModal
activate ProjectModal

ProjectModal -> Admin: Menampilkan form edit langsung pada Tab 2:\n[2. Detail Studi Kasus (/projects/[id])]
Admin -> ProjectModal: Ubah Latar Belakang & Solusi (longDescription)
Admin -> ProjectModal: Tambah / modifikasi poin Kemampuan Sistem (highlights)
ProjectModal -> ProjectModal: Live Checklist Preview ter-update otomatis
Admin -> ProjectModal: Perbarui Key Metrics & Tags
Admin -> ProjectModal: Klik tombol "Simpan Proyek"

== 3. Proses Pengiriman REST API / Persistensi Data ==
ProjectModal -> APIClient: handleSaveProject(data, isEdit = true)
activate APIClient
note over APIClient: Sanitasi payload:\n- title, subtitle, description\n- longDescription\n- highlights: string[]\n- tags: string[], metrics, year\n- image, demoUrl, githubUrl

APIClient -> DB: HTTP POST /rest/v1/projects?id=eq.{id}\n(Atau supabaseServer.update(payload).eq('id', id))
activate DB
DB -> DB: Simpan perubahan ke baris tabel 'projects'
DB --> APIClient: Status 200 OK\n{id: "proj_123", title: "...", highlights: [...]}
deactivate DB

APIClient --> ProjectModal: Return success = true
deactivate APIClient

ProjectModal -> ProjectModal: Tutup modal (isOpen = false)
deactivate ProjectModal

ProjectsTab -> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi toast: "Proyek berhasil diperbarui!"
ProjectsTab -> ProjectsTab: Update state lokal projects dengan data baru

== 4. Hasil Pembaruan pada Website Pengunjung ==
note over WebDetailPage: Saat pengunjung membuka halaman:\n/projects/[id]\nNext.js Server Component mengambil data terbaru via getProjectById(id)
WebDetailPage -> DB: SELECT * FROM projects WHERE id = :id
activate DB
DB --> WebDetailPage: Return data proyek & detail studi kasus
deactivate DB
WebDetailPage --> Admin: Halaman studi kasus website otomatis menampilkan narasi & checklist terbaru!

deactivate ProjectsTab
@enduml
